=== guide.md ===
# Demo app (demo-app)

Written by Aurora for this agent, except the last section.

## Accounts

Choose an account with the request header `x-aurora-connection-id: <connection id>`. Without it the gateway uses your only account, or refuses when there are several.

- `c`: L

## Your access

- `c`: full access

`tools.md` lists every operation and your access to it.

## Files in this folder

- `tools.md`: every operation and your access to it

## Documentation

- API documentation: https://docs.example.test/api

=== tools.md ===
# Demo app: operations and your access

Written by Aurora from the app's catalogue and your grants. The gateway decides every request;
workspace and organization policy can be stricter than this list, never looser.

## Accounts
- A: `c` L (full access)

This app has no catalogue operations.

## Requests that match no operation above
[allowed]
